<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f4f6f9;font-family:'Apple SD Gothic Neo',Arial,sans-serif;">
  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#f4f6f9;padding:40px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table width="560" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">

          <!-- 헤더 -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a73e8 0%,#0d47a1 100%);padding:36px 40px;text-align:center;">
              <p style="margin:0;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;letter-spacing:-0.3px;">CodeDash</p>
              <p style="margin:8px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);">비밀번호 재설정 안내</p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- 본문 -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:40px 40px 32px;">
              <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;">안녕하세요 👋</p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:15px;color:#555;line-height:1.7;">
                비밀번호 재설정 요청이 접수되었습니다.<br>
                아래 버튼을 클릭하여 새 비밀번호를 설정해 주세요.
              </p>

              <!-- 버튼 -->
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 auto 28px;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a73e8 0%,#0d47a1 100%);border-radius:8px;padding:0;">
                    <%= link_to "비밀번호 재설정하기",
                          edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token, host: "codedash.co.kr", port: nil, protocol: "https"),
                          style: "display:inline-block;padding:14px 36px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;" %>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- 만료 안내 -->
              <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                <tr>
                  <td style="background-color:#fff8e1;border-left:4px solid #ffc107;border-radius:4px;padding:14px 18px;">
                    <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#7a6200;">
                      ⏰ 이 링크는 <strong>15분</strong> 후에 만료됩니다.
                    </p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <p style="margin:24px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#999;line-height:1.7;">
                비밀번호 재설정을 요청하지 않으셨다면, 이 메일을 무시하시면 됩니다.<br>
                링크를 클릭하지 않으면 계정은 그대로 유지됩니다.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- 구분선 -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 40px;">
              <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #eee;margin:0;">
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- 푸터 -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;">
              <p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#bbb;">
                © 2025 CodeDash. All rights reserved.<br>
                <a href="http://codedash.co.kr" style="color:#1a73e8;text-decoration:none;">codedash.co.kr</a>
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
